sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Paced checkout probe
    participant C as Commerce and History
    participant R as Retention probe
    participant P as Disposable PostgreSQL source
    participant D as Disposable Debezium connector
    participant K as Disposable Kafka topic/group
    S->>C: 60 one-unit checkouts over 900 seconds
    S->>C: Replay keys, poll completion/freshness, sample stock/lag/memory
    R->>P: Create 20 fixture rows, publication and slot
    R->>D: Initial snapshot
    D->>K: 20 records; group checkpoint 20
    R->>D: Stop connector; wait for inactive slot
    loop 900-second retention interval
      R->>P: Commit update + insert every 15 seconds
      R->>P: Check retained WAL and unchanged confirmed LSN
      R->>K: Check unchanged bounds and consumer checkpoint
    end
    R->>D: Resume connector
    D->>K: Publish 120 retained changes
    R->>K: Read saved group and replay all 140 records
    R->>P: Compare exact folded state; remove owned resources
    S->>C: Require all terminal, exact stock, owner isolation and zero lag
